WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 42=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:44.640 --> 01:46.280
I've always loved you with all my heart.

01:50.519 --> 01:52.519
Now that we have a child,

01:55.359 --> 01:57.719
surely you can tell me
where they came from.

02:15.340 --> 02:19.460
♪Spring slips
from the branches once more♪

02:22.420 --> 02:26.380
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

02:28.380 --> 02:31.900
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

02:32.620 --> 02:35.420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

02:36.140 --> 02:38.420
♪Though all the world may fade♪

02:38.420 --> 02:41.260
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

02:42.759 --> 02:45.840
Little toes, let's stretch them.

02:46.439 --> 02:48.680
Stretch them all the way to Nanshan.

02:49.919 --> 02:52.280
There's a treasure in Nanshan.

02:53.280 --> 02:55.560
The treasure has a mountain of gold.

02:56.719 --> 03:00.759
And on that mountain
lie 1.2 hectares of fields.

03:01.319 --> 03:05.479
0.5 hectares are planted with buckwheat.

03:06.400 --> 03:10.719
The buckwheat feeds the little chicks.

03:11.479 --> 03:15.280
But the little chicks won't eat.

03:16.159 --> 03:17.599
Have you forgotten, Young Master?

03:19.912 --> 03:22.328
You brought them
back to the residence yourself,

03:26.904 --> 03:28.840
yet you're asking me
where they came from.

03:33.940 --> 03:38.140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

03:40.940 --> 03:44.940
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

03:46.900 --> 03:50.500
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

03:51.180 --> 03:53.740
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

03:54.900 --> 04:00.580
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

04:01.020 --> 04:05.140
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

04:05.140 --> 04:08.300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

04:08.660 --> 04:12.260
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

04:12.260 --> 04:14.940
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

04:14.940 --> 04:19.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

04:19.340 --> 04:22.340
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

04:22.340 --> 04:26.340
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

04:26.340 --> 04:30.420
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

04:36.560 --> 04:38.600
I just saw Jinqi rush out.

04:39.079 --> 04:39.959
Is something wrong?

04:41.279 --> 04:42.959
Old Master needed to see him urgently.

04:45.079 --> 04:45.839
Look.

04:46.439 --> 04:47.480
Someone's hungry.

04:48.879 --> 04:50.120
No more sucking on your hand,
Zhangcheng.

04:50.279 --> 04:51.439
Zhangcheng is awake.

04:53.000 --> 04:54.160
Let me hold her.

04:54.160 --> 04:57.220
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

04:59.020 --> 05:02.620
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

05:03.340 --> 05:06.060
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

05:07.060 --> 05:12.780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

05:36.279 --> 05:38.319
You came here all worked up,

05:39.399 --> 05:41.639
yet you haven't said
a word since you arrived.

05:46.639 --> 05:48.000
I remember Grandfather

05:48.296 --> 05:50.200
was never
particularly fond of Li Yingqiu.

05:51.120 --> 05:51.920
So why

05:52.632 --> 05:54.840
do you cherish
this Cold Mountain Painting so much?

05:56.040 --> 05:57.319
Even during festivals,

05:58.152 --> 05:59.830
instead of spending time
with the family,

06:00.296 --> 06:01.992
you keep this painting by your side,

06:04.199 --> 06:05.360
as though

06:07.752 --> 06:09.430
you were sitting with an old friend.

06:22.480 --> 06:23.439
Now

06:24.639 --> 06:26.160
that you're a father, too,

06:27.600 --> 06:29.639
there are some things
I can finally tell you.

06:31.639 --> 06:33.360
This Cold Mountain Painting

06:39.240 --> 06:42.199
was a treasured piece
in Grand Secretary Shen's collection.

06:55.688 --> 06:57.720
After the Shen family
was stripped of its property,

06:58.560 --> 06:59.920
by a twist of fate,

07:00.800 --> 07:03.199
your father-in-law recognized its worth

07:03.759 --> 07:05.120
and acquired it for his shop.

07:05.759 --> 07:07.720
Only then did I
have the chance to see it again.

07:26.160 --> 07:26.959
No wonder.

08:02.720 --> 08:05.079
Now, seeing you siblings

08:05.879 --> 08:08.600
raise families and live well,

08:10.800 --> 08:14.199
I don't regret choosing
to save my own life back then.

08:17.600 --> 08:20.800
But in the end, I failed to preserve
my integrity in my later years.

08:23.959 --> 08:26.199
I failed the teachings of the sages,

08:29.279 --> 08:32.639
and Grand Secretary Shen's faith in me.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.480
I remember

08:51.200 --> 08:52.600
you once arranged a marriage

08:53.320 --> 08:55.840
between me and Young Lady Shen Jialan.

08:57.799 --> 08:58.720
What kind of

09:01.919 --> 09:03.120
young lady was she?

09:07.320 --> 09:08.559
I met her once

09:09.080 --> 09:10.480
when she was six.

09:11.879 --> 09:15.240
Pure and unspoiled,
with a natural air of grace.

09:16.799 --> 09:18.240
Though she was a girl,

09:18.919 --> 09:19.960
Grand Secretary Shen

09:20.799 --> 09:23.720
treasured her dearly
and taught her with great care.

09:27.000 --> 09:28.799
That's all in the past.

09:29.544 --> 09:30.968
There's no need to speak of it now.

09:37.759 --> 09:38.559
Grandfather.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.200
I still have letters to answer.

09:43.159 --> 09:44.000
I'll take my leave.

09:51.120 --> 09:53.559
(Grand Secretary Shen Qihan.)

09:53.848 --> 09:56.184
(For deceiving the sovereign
and betraying imperial favor,)

09:56.216 --> 09:58.030
(and for disloyalty
in matters of state,)

09:58.200 --> 10:02.480
(all male members
of the Shen family are to be executed.)

10:02.720 --> 10:06.799
(The women are to be enslaved
in the Imperial Music Bureau.)

10:07.080 --> 10:10.600
(All property is to
be confiscated by the state.)

10:11.279 --> 10:14.159
You lie beneath the earth,
your bones turned to dust.

10:15.360 --> 10:19.120
I remain in this world,
my hair white as snow.

10:25.679 --> 10:27.440
I remain in this world,

10:30.919 --> 10:32.720
my hair white as snow.

10:43.980 --> 10:47.300
(Created by Li Yingqiu of Heyang)

11:09.720 --> 11:10.399
Young Madam.

11:15.399 --> 11:16.639
Why bring a brazier in here

11:17.080 --> 11:18.559
in the middle of summer?

11:19.304 --> 11:20.480
Young Master asked for it.

11:54.440 --> 11:55.919
I was too blinded by appearances.

11:58.679 --> 11:59.919
From beginning to end,

12:02.759 --> 12:04.480
I was the one who wronged you.

12:07.919 --> 12:09.320
You never wronged me.

12:48.820 --> 12:51.580
(Zhichun Hall
Daily Expense Account Book)

13:49.279 --> 13:50.519
You are Xu Lanxiang.

13:53.240 --> 13:53.879
We

13:54.648 --> 13:56.910
are husband and wife
who share every sorrow and joy,

13:58.559 --> 14:01.120
and face every fortune
and misfortune together.

14:19.220 --> 14:21.660
♪The golden sunset♪

14:21.660 --> 14:25.020
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

14:26.780 --> 14:29.260
♪All things fall silent♪

14:29.260 --> 14:32.820
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

14:33.540 --> 14:36.580
♪My restless heart♪

14:36.580 --> 14:40.220
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

14:40.940 --> 14:46.900
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

14:50.240 --> 14:50.919
You...

14:51.112 --> 14:51.910
Aren't you afraid?

14:54.039 --> 14:55.639
Can I save up all the credit and ask

14:55.640 --> 14:57.760
for everything at once
when I've decided what I want?

15:01.399 --> 15:03.960
I have to go.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.736
We have plenty of time ahead of us.

15:10.120 --> 15:11.080
As long as we care,

15:11.200 --> 15:12.399
our bond will never be broken.

15:12.400 --> 15:14.584
Didn't you say it blooms
at night and smells wonderful?

15:15.159 --> 15:16.120
I have feelings for Lady Xu.

15:16.600 --> 15:17.840
I wish to marry her.

15:18.159 --> 15:19.159
From this day forward,

15:19.240 --> 15:21.320
we are husband and wife,
sharing both fortune and misfortune.

15:21.320 --> 15:22.000
Stop!

15:22.120 --> 15:23.240
Prefect Liu, are you trying

15:23.240 --> 15:25.096
to indirectly
cause my husband's death today?

15:29.200 --> 15:30.120
I'm no gentleman.

15:31.120 --> 15:31.919
I get scared.

15:33.080 --> 15:34.120
I act on impulse.

15:35.120 --> 15:36.559
But for as long as I live,

15:38.080 --> 15:39.080
I will never betray you.

15:39.080 --> 15:41.100
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

15:41.100 --> 15:45.060
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

15:45.340 --> 15:51.380
♪You and I will walk there together♪

16:03.380 --> 16:04.820
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

16:05.460 --> 16:14.720
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

16:14.720 --> 16:16.728
Before Fourth Young Lady's
bridal gift ceremony,

16:17.360 --> 16:17.960
the First Madam

16:19.399 --> 16:21.840
discovered a dark patch on her abdomen.

16:22.559 --> 16:24.080
It had ulcerated and begun to bleed.

16:25.360 --> 16:27.320
She secretly sent for a physician,

16:29.240 --> 16:30.679
who said it was a malignant sore

16:31.919 --> 16:33.440
and there was no cure.

16:36.120 --> 16:38.080
The First Madam kept it from everyone

16:39.176 --> 16:40.630
and strictly ordered Yinchen and me

16:42.080 --> 16:43.919
not to breathe a word of it.

16:50.120 --> 16:50.919
That's impossible.

16:52.248 --> 16:54.776
The physician you found
must have been incompetent.

17:01.720 --> 17:04.130
The Treatise on the Origins
and Symptoms of Diseases states,

17:04.440 --> 17:09.000
"When a sore itches, aches,
burns, swells, and oozes profusely,

17:09.480 --> 17:10.640
accompanied by a high fever,

17:11.200 --> 17:13.039
it is known as a malignant sore."

17:13.368 --> 17:14.440
It is difficult to heal

17:14.696 --> 17:15.790
and difficult to treat.

17:16.488 --> 17:17.960
If it develops on the hands or feet,

17:18.319 --> 17:19.839
amputation

17:20.160 --> 17:21.880
may offer a slim chance of survival.

17:22.720 --> 17:25.400
But when it develops on the abdomen...

17:26.160 --> 17:28.839
The infection has now spread
deep into her internal organs.

17:29.759 --> 17:33.319
Your Lordship, you should make funeral
arrangements as soon as possible.

17:52.599 --> 17:54.119
I have failed you as a son.

17:55.359 --> 17:56.960
You were unwell,

17:57.680 --> 17:59.079
yet I never noticed.

18:02.839 --> 18:03.640
It seems

18:05.359 --> 18:07.480
experience still wins out in the end.

18:11.880 --> 18:13.319
You little rascal.

18:15.480 --> 18:17.319
In the end, you still can't escape

18:17.440 --> 18:19.680
the Buddha's palm.

18:23.920 --> 18:25.839
How could my little schemes

18:27.640 --> 18:29.880
ever compare with your great wisdom?

18:51.400 --> 18:53.799
Birth, aging, illness, and death

18:54.240 --> 18:56.279
are inevitable parts of life.

18:58.039 --> 18:59.759
You're with child.

19:01.319 --> 19:03.279
You may grieve for me,

19:04.680 --> 19:07.119
but you mustn't let yourself
be consumed by sorrow

19:07.400 --> 19:09.279
and harm your health.

19:14.200 --> 19:15.119
Otherwise,

19:16.680 --> 19:18.599
even after I'm gone,

19:19.319 --> 19:21.279
I'll never be at peace.

19:24.160 --> 19:25.079
I understand.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.279
Taking good care of myself

19:31.359 --> 19:33.079
and living well

19:35.319 --> 19:36.920
will be the greatest way

19:38.559 --> 19:40.119
to honor you.

19:43.319 --> 19:47.160
That's the daughter I raised.

20:00.599 --> 20:01.759
Lanxiang.

20:09.680 --> 20:10.559
Mother.

20:13.880 --> 20:15.160
Jinqi

20:16.079 --> 20:19.079
knows what he's doing.

20:19.920 --> 20:21.359
I don't worry about him.

20:23.160 --> 20:24.119
The only one

20:25.039 --> 20:27.599
I can't stop worrying about is Xiushu.

20:29.000 --> 20:30.319
This world

20:31.359 --> 20:33.319
is harsh on women.

20:36.279 --> 20:38.960
But seeing how you treat Xiulai,

20:39.920 --> 20:41.079
Xiuru,

20:42.039 --> 20:43.319
and Suhua,

20:46.440 --> 20:48.920
I can finally put my mind at ease.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.359
Don't worry, Mother.

20:53.519 --> 20:55.400
I've watched Xiushu grow up.

20:56.640 --> 20:58.319
I will never let anyone mistreat her.

21:05.960 --> 21:08.119
Ever since you
married into the Lin family,

21:11.720 --> 21:13.920
because of your background,

21:15.920 --> 21:19.079
I've always treated you coldly.

21:25.319 --> 21:27.519
I was foolish.

21:28.440 --> 21:30.079
I've wronged you.

21:34.319 --> 21:35.960
Though you never cared for me,

21:36.792 --> 21:39.260
you never treated me harshly
or made things difficult for me.

21:40.079 --> 21:42.920
Instead, you often stood up
for me before the elders.

21:44.279 --> 21:47.039
Even if you only did it
for Young Master's sake,

21:47.240 --> 21:48.790
I still benefited from your kindness

21:50.519 --> 21:51.680
and have always been grateful.

22:08.559 --> 22:11.200
These are the household
authority tokens.

22:15.400 --> 22:16.920
From now on,

22:17.960 --> 22:18.960
the Lin Residence

22:19.920 --> 22:22.000
is in your hands.

22:34.599 --> 22:36.400
My Xiushu

22:37.200 --> 22:38.359
is also entrusted

22:39.599 --> 22:40.160
to you...

22:47.799 --> 22:48.359
Mother.

23:53.680 --> 23:54.119
Mother...

23:54.160 --> 23:54.720
Mother.

23:59.279 --> 23:59.880
Mother!

23:59.960 --> 24:00.839
Mother!

24:01.480 --> 24:02.400
Mother!

24:03.519 --> 24:04.440
Grandmother!

24:04.839 --> 24:05.960
Aunt Shunhua!

24:05.960 --> 24:06.880
Mother!

24:09.799 --> 24:10.839
Aunt Shunhua!

24:10.839 --> 24:13.780
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

24:14.220 --> 24:19.820
♪Each plant endures
its own trials before reaching shore♪

24:20.180 --> 24:23.180
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

24:23.180 --> 24:26.540
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

24:26.540 --> 24:32.300
♪Yet their proud spirit
fades with wind and snow♪

24:32.300 --> 24:35.580
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

24:35.580 --> 24:38.620
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

24:38.620 --> 24:44.180
♪Watching the old
and new take turns in this world♪

24:44.380 --> 24:50.100
♪Spring comes, and I smile
upon a garden in full bloom♪

24:50.460 --> 24:56.420
♪Autumn passes,
and I let the blossoms fade away♪

24:56.780 --> 25:00.580
♪A scroll of time slowly unfolds♪

25:00.580 --> 25:09.300
♪I read every joy
and sorrow behind the curtain♪

25:10.920 --> 25:12.880
First Madam!

25:13.640 --> 25:14.960
First Madam!

25:14.960 --> 25:16.319
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

25:16.319 --> 25:17.640
First Madam!

25:18.079 --> 25:19.440
It's broad daylight.

25:19.450 --> 25:21.150
Why are you wailing
as if someone has died?

25:21.160 --> 25:22.440
How utterly improper.

25:25.519 --> 25:26.240
Master.

25:27.920 --> 25:29.559
The First Madam has passed away.

25:48.599 --> 25:49.319
Changzheng.

25:51.160 --> 25:52.559
Shunhua is gone.

25:55.880 --> 25:56.839
Shunhua...

26:00.000 --> 26:01.359
is gone.

26:03.559 --> 26:06.400
Aunt Shunhua passed away so suddenly.

26:08.079 --> 26:09.279
With such a large household,

26:10.079 --> 26:12.880
now there's no one
to manage its affairs.

26:14.359 --> 26:16.119
But Aunt Shunhua's funeral

26:16.519 --> 26:17.920
still needs to be arranged.

26:19.039 --> 26:21.119
This is far too important to neglect.

26:22.599 --> 26:23.200
If

26:24.359 --> 26:25.680
it isn't handled properly,

26:26.359 --> 26:27.519
Uncle Changzheng

26:28.960 --> 26:30.559
will lose face as well.

26:34.519 --> 26:35.519
In the past,

26:36.359 --> 26:37.680
all the affairs of the residence

26:38.920 --> 26:40.680
were handled by your Aunt Shunhua.

26:41.480 --> 26:41.920
But...

26:42.640 --> 26:43.319
now,

26:43.640 --> 26:45.960
what are we supposed to do?

26:47.400 --> 26:49.920
Shunhua and I were as close as sisters.

26:50.759 --> 26:51.920
She was gravely ill,

26:53.759 --> 26:55.839
yet she never told me a thing.

26:59.880 --> 27:01.079
And now,

27:03.976 --> 27:06.350
she's even left the household
in the Young Madam's hands.

27:10.680 --> 27:13.759
After all these years as sisters,

27:17.200 --> 27:21.079
she didn't trust me at all.

27:23.599 --> 27:26.039
It breaks my heart.

27:26.519 --> 27:27.920
Lanxiang was born a servant,

27:28.599 --> 27:30.680
so her knowledge
and experience are limited.

27:31.880 --> 27:33.839
She's never dealt
with anything this important.

27:34.559 --> 27:37.079
She's bound to make mistakes

27:37.599 --> 27:39.079
and make a laughingstock of herself.

27:41.480 --> 27:43.960
Why don't you leave
Aunt Shunhua's funeral

27:45.160 --> 27:46.720
to me?

27:51.559 --> 27:52.599
You have a point.

27:53.839 --> 27:54.799
I'll leave it to you.

27:55.096 --> 27:56.056
You can handle it.

27:59.079 --> 27:59.720
All right.

27:59.800 --> 28:01.480
Mother already
made all the arrangements.

28:03.599 --> 28:04.799
Father, you needn't worry.

28:07.680 --> 28:10.319
You must be beside yourself with grief.

28:10.519 --> 28:12.279
Your mother has already passed away.

28:12.400 --> 28:15.000
How could she have arranged
her own funeral?

28:15.519 --> 28:16.359
Exactly.

28:16.920 --> 28:19.200
Everyone in the Lin Residence
can only rely on me now.

28:27.480 --> 28:28.279
Fengxian,

28:29.119 --> 28:31.559
may I ask which feng shui master
in the city we should hire?

28:34.759 --> 28:35.160
Well...

28:37.440 --> 28:38.400
How would I know

28:39.279 --> 28:40.319
on such short notice?

28:40.400 --> 28:42.440
The First Madam
already chose a feng shui master.

28:42.960 --> 28:43.920
Head Butler Yang,

28:44.119 --> 28:46.400
take some men
with Young Master's calling card at once

28:46.559 --> 28:48.200
and invite Mister Zuo
from Bajiao Street.

28:48.440 --> 28:49.119
Yes.

28:51.839 --> 28:52.920
Fengxian,

28:53.256 --> 28:55.224
where are the First Madam's
burial clothes?

28:55.720 --> 28:58.119
Who will dress her in them
for the initial encoffining?

28:59.720 --> 29:01.240
Aunt Shunhua passed away so suddenly.

29:01.250 --> 29:03.256
How could she possibly
have burial clothes ready?

29:03.830 --> 29:05.144
Shouldn't we hurry and buy them?

29:14.168 --> 29:16.790
The First Madam's burial clothes
are in the rear house attic,

29:16.920 --> 29:18.680
inside the largest camphorwood chest.

29:19.240 --> 29:21.160
Wei, take some people
and bring them here.

29:21.920 --> 29:22.440
Yes.

29:26.160 --> 29:26.839
Madam Wu.

29:28.728 --> 29:30.030
Once the burial clothes arrive,

29:30.480 --> 29:32.559
please help me

29:33.279 --> 29:34.720
dress the First Madam in them.

29:36.039 --> 29:36.839
Let us attend to her

29:37.440 --> 29:38.480
one last time.

29:40.839 --> 29:41.960
Rest assured, Young Madam.

29:53.160 --> 29:53.799
Xiulai,

29:54.200 --> 29:55.359
Mother's coffin

29:55.608 --> 29:57.640
is in the right-side room
behind the family shrine.

29:58.359 --> 29:59.799
Take a few careful servants

29:59.896 --> 30:01.016
and have them carry it over.

30:01.128 --> 30:02.070
Keep a close eye on it.

30:02.328 --> 30:03.992
Don't let it get so much
as a single bump.

30:06.790 --> 30:07.832
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

30:13.160 --> 30:13.759
Xiuwan.

30:14.359 --> 30:15.039
Suhua.

30:16.910 --> 30:19.130
Mother also had the mourning clothes
and funeral banners

30:19.144 --> 30:20.088
prepared in advance.

30:20.279 --> 30:22.319
They're against
the left wall in the storeroom.

30:22.552 --> 30:24.030
Take some people and bring them out,

30:24.072 --> 30:25.110
and then distribute them.

30:25.688 --> 30:26.920
- All right.
- All right.

30:37.400 --> 30:38.119
Lanxiang.

30:38.880 --> 30:40.039
What can I do?

30:45.400 --> 30:47.000
I'll leave what Mother cared about most

30:47.640 --> 30:48.880
to you, Xiuru.

30:50.200 --> 30:53.080
There will be many people and much
to attend to during the funeral.

30:53.400 --> 30:54.279
Xiuru, please

30:54.680 --> 30:56.240
be sure to take good care of Xiushu.

31:01.039 --> 31:02.119
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

31:02.960 --> 31:04.799
I'll make sure Mother can rest in peace.

31:11.680 --> 31:13.160
Once the feng shui master arrives

31:13.368 --> 31:15.200
and sets the time
for the final encoffining

31:15.272 --> 31:16.840
and the date of the funeral procession,

31:17.270 --> 31:19.944
have Jinqiao and Jincen go to each
residence to announce the death.

31:20.072 --> 31:22.440
That will give our relatives
and friends time to prepare.

31:24.920 --> 31:25.359
All right.

31:27.000 --> 31:27.759
Then I...

31:30.632 --> 31:31.830
Mother has pain in her chest.

31:32.920 --> 31:34.240
I'll take her back to rest first.

31:38.344 --> 31:39.240
Let's go, Mother.

31:39.599 --> 31:40.400
Shunhua...

31:47.240 --> 31:47.680
Father.

31:48.872 --> 31:50.536
So, is everything properly arranged?

31:51.599 --> 31:53.000
If anything is amiss,

31:54.160 --> 31:55.400
please correct me.

31:56.920 --> 31:57.599
I wouldn't...

32:01.352 --> 32:02.472
Everything is in order.

32:02.808 --> 32:03.736
Everything is in order.

32:05.880 --> 32:08.480
Since your mother put you
in charge of the household,

32:09.079 --> 32:10.440
do your best.

32:11.599 --> 32:12.599
Your grandfather

32:13.359 --> 32:14.799
must be grieving terribly.

32:15.400 --> 32:17.119
I'll go keep him company.

32:22.460 --> 32:26.740
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

32:32.980 --> 32:39.100
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

32:39.100 --> 32:43.540
(Spirit Tablet
of Madam Qin of the Lin Family)

32:46.640 --> 32:48.839
I was only following Mother's wishes

32:48.920 --> 32:50.824
and saying whatever
I could to reassure Master.

32:53.480 --> 32:55.039
How do you know everything?

32:56.279 --> 32:57.400
You even know exactly

32:59.432 --> 33:00.790
where the burial clothes are.

33:28.200 --> 33:29.480
(For the feng shui master,)

33:30.039 --> 33:32.480
(invite Mister Zuo from Bajiao Street.)

33:33.920 --> 33:37.480
(The burial clothes are in the attic
of the rear house at Rongzhang House,)

33:38.039 --> 33:39.920
(inside the largest camphorwood chest.)

33:41.519 --> 33:45.200
(The coffin is in the right-side room
behind the family shrine.)

33:47.039 --> 33:48.359
(During the initial encoffining,)

33:49.240 --> 33:52.880
(Lanxiang and Madam Wu
will dress me in the burial clothes.)

33:55.640 --> 33:59.480
(Once the time for the final encoffining
and the funeral date are set,)

34:01.240 --> 34:03.240
(go to each residence
to announce the death,)

34:06.000 --> 34:07.160
(so our relatives and friends)

34:07.720 --> 34:09.320
(have time to prepare.)

34:10.100 --> 34:13.580
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

34:15.020 --> 34:18.100
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

34:19.180 --> 34:23.540
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

34:23.540 --> 34:26.860
♪While two pairs
of eyes watch from below♪

34:31.840 --> 34:32.800
Give this to me.

34:34.340 --> 34:37.740
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

34:38.740 --> 34:43.300
♪Four seasons wax and wane,
year after year♪

34:43.300 --> 34:46.500
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

34:47.620 --> 34:50.580
♪You're a river flowing to shore♪

34:51.400 --> 34:53.039
Thank you for persuading me to resign

34:53.280 --> 34:54.440
and return to Jinling.

34:56.039 --> 34:58.039
Only then could I stay by Mother's side

34:58.568 --> 35:00.110
and fulfill some of my duty as her son.

35:01.519 --> 35:02.039
Otherwise,

35:02.760 --> 35:04.440
I'd still be in the capital now,

35:05.280 --> 35:07.280
and I'm afraid I wouldn't
even have seen Mother

35:08.840 --> 35:09.760
one last time.

35:12.020 --> 35:15.220
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

35:16.260 --> 35:20.620
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

35:20.670 --> 35:23.256
It was also because you
were willing to listen, Young Master.

35:28.280 --> 35:30.039
Mother was a wise woman.

35:32.119 --> 35:33.800
She and Father didn't get along,

35:34.920 --> 35:36.960
but she never took it out
on the younger generation.

35:39.239 --> 35:41.719
Xiulai, Xiuru,

35:41.840 --> 35:42.960
and Jinlan

35:43.719 --> 35:45.880
were never neglected

35:46.920 --> 35:48.599
in manners, learning, or upbringing.

35:49.752 --> 35:51.510
They all have
very different personalities,

35:53.760 --> 35:55.480
but they are all good at heart.

35:58.519 --> 36:00.719
Ever since I was little, Mother told me

36:01.880 --> 36:03.719
that one tree alone
cannot make a forest.

36:07.592 --> 36:09.480
I had to treat
my younger siblings sincerely

36:11.960 --> 36:14.000
for them to treat me
sincerely in return.

36:18.039 --> 36:19.079
She also told me

36:21.039 --> 36:22.039
that Xiuru

36:23.360 --> 36:24.960
may seem gentle but is strong-willed,

36:29.440 --> 36:31.440
so Xiushu should
spend more time with her,

36:35.039 --> 36:36.400
lest she be left alone

36:38.639 --> 36:39.719
to dwell on things

36:41.159 --> 36:42.119
and go astray.

37:03.599 --> 37:04.440
Just cry.

37:07.719 --> 37:09.159
As children,

37:12.328 --> 37:13.720
we wish to care for our parents,

37:14.456 --> 37:16.392
but they may be gone
before we have the chance.

37:24.760 --> 37:26.199
I'll cry with you.

37:28.900 --> 37:33.700
♪Even if these trials
consume my whole life♪

37:34.100 --> 37:38.260
♪I'll only return
to the moment our fate began♪

37:38.660 --> 37:41.900
♪I've searched and searched,
wandering in circles♪

37:41.900 --> 37:44.900
♪Yet I can never mend that old dream♪

37:45.260 --> 37:47.820
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

37:48.260 --> 37:52.740
♪Thankfully, these trials
have spared me a lifetime♪

37:53.020 --> 37:58.140
♪In this life and the next,
it will always be you♪

37:58.780 --> 38:07.140
♪I only pray that fate
lets us meet sooner♪

38:16.440 --> 38:18.580
Aunt Shunhua must have
been delirious from her illness

38:18.599 --> 38:19.880
and misled by that servant.

38:20.744 --> 38:21.630
Mother is kindhearted,

38:21.640 --> 38:23.690
but you can't just let that servant
do as she pleases.

38:24.679 --> 38:26.480
Aunt Shunhua cared about her dignity.

38:26.880 --> 38:27.840
We can't let her become

38:28.400 --> 38:29.912
a laughingstock even after her death.

38:31.159 --> 38:32.840
When I gave birth to Jincen,

38:34.280 --> 38:35.280
I had a difficult labor.

38:37.440 --> 38:39.719
It was Shunhua who sent for a physician

38:41.400 --> 38:43.400
and stayed by my side the entire time.

38:43.960 --> 38:45.360
She practically

38:45.800 --> 38:48.920
pulled me back from the brink of death.

38:52.400 --> 38:54.079
Mother, you mustn't
let Aunt Shunhua down.

38:54.360 --> 38:55.920
You must keep the Lin family together.

39:00.000 --> 39:00.800
But Shunhua...

39:03.000 --> 39:05.800
Shunhua already put the Young Madam
in charge of the household.

39:09.760 --> 39:10.840
There's still Old Master.

39:10.920 --> 39:12.400
As long as Old Master gives the word,

39:13.280 --> 39:15.280
that servant has no right
to run the Lin family.

39:25.260 --> 39:28.260
(Legacy and Glory)

39:33.880 --> 39:34.679
Aunt Lanxiang.

39:41.400 --> 39:42.960
Why have you come to the family shrine?

39:43.440 --> 39:44.760
Why aren't you with Mother?

39:45.100 --> 39:48.159
(Lu Jun, age 15. Lu Yingzhi, age 11
Lin Xiulai's son and daughter)

39:48.159 --> 39:49.159
We have something

39:49.368 --> 39:50.670
to tell you, Aunt Lanxiang.

39:57.810 --> 40:00.040
What is it that's so important
that you need to tell me?

40:09.119 --> 40:10.599
Aunt Fengxian gave these to us.

40:11.976 --> 40:14.520
These are ritual vessels
used for offerings to your grandmother.

40:14.639 --> 40:15.559
How did you get it?

40:16.599 --> 40:18.320
Madam Deng, who serves Aunt Fengxian,

40:18.920 --> 40:20.079
gave this to Yingzhi.

40:20.800 --> 40:21.559
She told Yingzhi

40:22.000 --> 40:23.360
to secretly hide it in your chest

40:23.480 --> 40:25.400
where you keep your personal clothes.

40:26.519 --> 40:29.039
Madam Deng said that
now that the First Madam is gone,

40:29.640 --> 40:30.920
from now on, the Lin Residence

40:31.480 --> 40:33.239
will be managed by the Second Madam,

40:33.368 --> 40:35.230
which means Aunt Fengxian
will be in charge.

40:35.719 --> 40:37.360
If I obediently do as I'm told,

40:37.528 --> 40:39.840
we'll be allowed to continue staying
at the Lin Residence.

40:40.559 --> 40:41.800
If I don't,

40:42.639 --> 40:45.239
she'll drive all three of us out

40:46.119 --> 40:47.639
and leave us homeless on the streets.

40:50.440 --> 40:52.960
Aunt Fengxian not only looks down on us,

40:52.970 --> 40:55.210
but she has also looked down
on you too, Aunt Lanxiang.

40:55.360 --> 40:57.760
Why don't we give her

40:58.360 --> 40:59.760
a taste of her own medicine?

41:00.280 --> 41:02.440
I'll slip this jade into
Aunt Fengxian's room

41:02.920 --> 41:03.840
without her knowing...

41:03.840 --> 41:04.920
Absolutely not.

41:06.536 --> 41:08.910
Why shouldn't we let a wicked person
suffer the consequences

41:08.920 --> 41:10.119
of her own actions?

41:11.639 --> 41:12.960
What Aunt Fengxian did to me

41:13.199 --> 41:14.039
was wrong.

41:14.559 --> 41:15.639
If I do the same thing,

41:16.320 --> 41:17.679
wouldn't that make me just like her

41:17.784 --> 41:19.288
and turn me into a wicked person, too?

41:20.056 --> 41:21.550
If we repay resentment with kindness,

41:22.760 --> 41:24.000
what do we repay kindness with?

41:31.880 --> 41:32.280
Come here.

41:35.119 --> 41:35.480
Sit down.

41:42.632 --> 41:43.760
Let me ask you something.

41:44.719 --> 41:45.880
What do the two of you

41:46.679 --> 41:47.719
live for?

41:56.480 --> 41:58.360
I live for my parents,

41:59.280 --> 42:01.559
for my daughter Zhangcheng,

42:02.280 --> 42:04.119
and above all, for myself.

42:18.960 --> 42:21.840
For the tender yellow-green
shoots of spring,

42:24.440 --> 42:26.079
the evening breeze and stars of summer,

42:30.376 --> 42:32.150
the blue skies and red leaves of autumn,

42:33.640 --> 42:35.688
and the white snow
and red plum blossoms of winter.

42:39.079 --> 42:41.639
For the first fresh
river catch I taste each year.

42:41.760 --> 42:43.800
For pumpkins, sweet and soft.

42:47.736 --> 42:50.136
For the fireworks and firecrackers
on Chinese New Year's Eve.

42:51.592 --> 42:54.030
For the wonderful plays performed
by the Furong Troupe.

42:57.880 --> 42:59.719
I have so many reasons to live.

43:00.119 --> 43:00.920
What about you?

43:04.820 --> 43:07.380
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:25.100 --> 43:26.850
(Construction Supervisor,
Ministry of Works)

43:46.060 --> 43:50.180
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:53.020 --> 43:57.540
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

43:58.820 --> 44:02.740
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:03.420 --> 44:06.180
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:06.900 --> 44:09.220
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:09.220 --> 44:12.300
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:13.820 --> 44:18.060
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:20.980 --> 44:25.140
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:26.940 --> 44:30.500
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:30.500 --> 44:34.060
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:34.860 --> 44:40.540
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:40.900 --> 44:45.220
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:45.580 --> 44:48.540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:48.540 --> 44:52.300
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:52.300 --> 44:55.180
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:55.180 --> 44:59.260
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

44:59.260 --> 45:02.620
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:02.620 --> 45:06.380
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:06.380 --> 45:10.380
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:11.140 --> 45:15.300
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:15.300 --> 45:18.740
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:18.740 --> 45:22.380
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:22.380 --> 45:25.260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:25.260 --> 45:29.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:29.340 --> 45:32.700
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:32.700 --> 45:36.340
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:36.340 --> 45:44.140
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
